            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Musa odwoko ni, “Kiber oyido timo gino, kwoŋbedo Jomisir jobino winjo marac gi cowirok mar'ogwaŋe ma wabino miyo Rwoth Were mawan. Ka wanomiy cowirok ma Jomisir jokimiti neno kama joneno iye wan, jobino neko wan gi goco telin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
